meta {
  name: List Round Chains
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions/{{sessionId}}/rounds/{{roundNumber}}/chains
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{instructorToken}}
}

tests {
  test("lists the round's Concept Chains with author and voter display names", function() {
    expect(res.status).to.equal(200);
    expect(res.body.roundNumber).to.be.a("number");
    expect(res.body.chains).to.be.an("array");
  });
}

docs {
  # GET /api/v1/sessions/:sessionId/rounds/:roundNumber/chains (`listRoundChains`)

  Lists the **Concept Chains** submitted for Gameplay Round `:roundNumber` (`1` or `2`), enriched with `participantDisplayName` and each peer vote's `voterDisplayName`.

  ## Visibility Rule
  - **Supervising Instructor (`{{instructorToken}}`)**: Sees all chains in the round at all times.
  - **Learner (`{{participantToken}}`)**: During `round-{N}:chain-mapping`, sees **only their own** chains; from `round-{N}:peer-adjudication` onward, sees **all classmates' chains** in that round.

  ## Responses & Error Codes (`ApiErrorCode`)
  - **`200 OK`**: `{ sessionId, roundNumber, chains: SubmittedChainListItem[] }`
  - **`400 INVALID_REQUEST_BODY`**: `:roundNumber` is not `1` or `2`.
  - **`401 UNAUTHORIZED_TOKEN`**: Missing, invalid, or Account Token instead of a session Capability Token.
  - **`403 FORBIDDEN_ROLE`**: Token belongs to another Game Session.
  - **`404 SESSION_NOT_FOUND`**: Unknown `sessionId`.
}
